{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"16658","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:16658","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10483","characterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"源远流长的西行寺家的大小姐，身为白玉楼的主人的亡灵公主。有脚的。一眼便能看出是什么都不会去想的轻浮的性格，但实际上因为已存在了一段相当长的日子，故此是有一定的知识，有时候会说出些仿佛在追寻着事物的原委般的说话，却往往是没有要点的。已成为了1000年以上的亡灵。不擅长对自己的能力没有效用的蓬莱人。是住在冥界的幽灵们的管理者。‘萃梦想’对战模式的对话中，被萃香指摘她对现世还有执念。“春雪异变”的元凶，让妖梦把“春度”收集起来，把名为“西行妖”的妖怪樱树的封印解封，使埋葬在树下的人复活。与八云紫是老朋友。生前为某“歌圣”的女儿。这个歌圣的名字没有被明确的记录下来，但在 ‘妖妖梦’中登场的和歌为“西行法师”的歌曲，再者幽幽子的姓是“西行寺”。西行寺家的古老文献中有写着“富士见之女孩”，在拥有“操纵死灵的的能力”之后便变成了“诱导别人死亡的能力”，因为厌恶简单地就能诱导人死亡的能力，与每当满开盛放时把许多人都吸引著，并成为了许多人的葬生之地，诱导别人死亡，最后化成了妖树“西行妖”的樱树。于是在“西行妖”满开之时，为了不再让“西行妖”的樱花满开，最后于树下自尽。成为亡灵后忘掉所有生前的记忆，也变得认为诱导别人死亡是一件蛮快乐的事。 (荣获第一届东方最萌冠军)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在历史上西行法师是藤原秀郷的九代孙，是藤原四大家中北家后裔，而北家开祖是藤原不比等的第二子藤原房前。若把西行寺幽幽子与藤原妹红的父亲比拟为历史人物，她们两人就有远亲关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"亡灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"操纵死亡程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e48a9da0c85b68dc9bff254c340a32988e7d433c926bf7aeb21dae10f5e26368.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3203b696470b87edb27965ae16efb8069e69f6855d79327a84c3e8f6c3ef897.webp","width":126,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_11614","characterName":"幽人的庭师","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽人的庭师","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"西行寺行家专属庭师兼幽幽子的护卫。她是代替现时行踪不明，第一代的爷爷魂魄妖忌的第二代庭师。虽也是幽幽子的剑术指导师，但幽幽子仍是把她看作庭师来看待。所谓半人半灵，除了她本身作为“半人”的人类身体的半身，还有就是一只一直紧随她的巨大幽灵，那就是她的“半灵”的半身，也是其“魂魄”家族的共同特征 (“魂魄”家族全为半人半灵,因有半灵的关系，比一般人类长寿。并世世代代侍奉著西行寺家，其后代妖梦就是其中之一)。二刀流剑士，手上有两柄刀，拥有一挥即可杀死十来只幽灵之杀伤力的长刀“楼观剑”，和可以把人的迷惘斩断的“白楼剑”。因为性格认真又率直，常被身边的人（特别是幽幽子）捉弄。感受性很强，在‘永夜抄’的结局中，变成了狂气之眼。不擅长面对怪物等恐怖的事。 ‘文花帖（书籍）’中，也会使用了替幽幽子代管的“人魂灯”(‘香霖堂’第12话“模糊的光、窗户的雪”中登场，用作收集幽灵用的道具)，把幽灵收集。根据不同的作品，其性格也有若干的不同，性格并没有被固定起来。‘儚月抄’中那完全天然的性格与‘妖妖梦’中那种逞强的性格截然不同。‘妖妖梦’时瞳孔为红色，‘萃梦想’以后变成了青色。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"半人半灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"使用剑术程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff2fba2e98d606edd5cabe06b21c90c3b6addfda44d96433583cf53ad55fa04b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/252c2df78fb394b8950a5fd2cac232ed665afc965fabe91aa9895c542cb3660d.webp","width":231,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12897","characterName":"幽谷響子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12897","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12897","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽谷響子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"东方第十三作《东方神灵庙》二面道中BOSS & 二面BOSS"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"种族：山灵"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力：能够反射声音的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大家在登山的时候有没有高喊过「呀喝～！」呢？如果能清晰听到「YAHOO ~！」的声音，就是妖怪山彦的杰作。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她居住在山中。只要听到哪里有愉快的喊声，她就会大声高喊回应，真是自在的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过最近卻流行一种迷信，认为「回音（山彦）只是声波的反弹而已啦」，让她顿悟世俗的空虚而皈依佛门。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她的能力和诵经可真是如鱼得水，每天都在山里诵经。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"于是最近人们又感到害怕：「杳无人迹的深山里居然听得到诵经的声音」，总算让她保住了一点妖怪的颜面。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12897"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12897","value":"山彦"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12897","value":"反射声音的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a613ac31ffa163cc099980e39ae00735ba00045515e584a8996ba7825c55edb8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9d841e3a6db0c397968bd8979fce5a1046fe66b3e1d5bb05498c495bfa90135.webp","width":119,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12898","characterName":"宮古芳香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12898","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12898","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"宮古芳香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"被什么人复活了的神秘尸体。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为被操纵的人偶，守护着什么重要之物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有异常的怪力和没有痛楚的肉体，正面相攻的话难以对付，但思考回路就如上个世纪的电脑一般，要逃走的话还是很容易的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"战斗时，她一受伤就会啃食灵魂增加体力，因而难以打倒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过，要逃走的话还是很容易的（这点很重要）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她的身体非常坚硬，关节不会弯曲。行走不便。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其主人建议她做做柔软体操。如果柔韧性不够而去运动的话会受伤的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说只是一只僵尸。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她究竟是在守护什么呢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而且安排了如此没有意义的看守的，她的主人会是谁呢？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12898"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12898","value":"僵尸"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12898","value":"什么都能吃的能力（人类如果被她啃食掉一部分身体，会暂时变成僵尸）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f98d9f70c55197fced9c021797d3a935c0de9542635781add4d171530703770d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8ce1fbe28d5fdbc130252a8107200ba5061a0dfb9d8043ab4dbdc81066244e13.webp","width":127,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20139","characterName":"龙脉を司る风水师","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20139","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"龙脉を司る风水师","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"通过长时间自己诅咒自己从而沉眠的古代人。以一旦死去就从轮回转生之轮脱离出来这种方法达成不老不死的仙人。但实际进行时却没这么顺利，结果还是要被死神看见并找上门来的样子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"比起用同样的手段在活到现在的丰聪耳神子，她似乎并不亲近接纳幻想乡，大概是适应能力低的缘故。这个能从过去的她当中窥看出一二。在生前（？）也没有接纳从大陆传来的佛教，反而信仰了与自古以来的神道教更接近的道教，于是理所当然的，使用的法术和模样也不彻底的拖着过去落伍那套的影子。不过，这倒不如说是她的作风好了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然自己辩解说能力是跟风水有关的东西（×1 能力是自己申请的），不过对她来说这种自然信仰的意义跟神道的那方面根本没多大变化。在学习道教之前自己身上已经存在的东西，也继续成为了现在的能力而行使着。就因为这样，她身上的什么地方总是能和某种古老的传统感相重叠。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然性格温厚，但思考方式也跟古时一直亳无变化，与普通人完全脱节了，然而姑且不论这点的话，也可说是很有仙人那种风格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现在有时候会和丰聪耳神子一同行动，有时候则自己一人在努力修行（×2 例如说，治好自己的时差问题）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为仙人的最重要的一件事，就是跟寿命斗争吧。由此演变而成的跟死神战斗的形式也很多，但这并非什么容易的事。仙人可以说是，人类为了到达不死而一直不断努力的种族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其中，尸解仙就是既能让已死的人的复活，又能逃过寿命限制的仙人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成为尸解仙的方法有很多，她所用的方法似乎是「完全舍弃肉体，把灵魂寄宿到某个对象之上。到适当的时候，这对象就会变成自己的姿态，取而代之尸体就会变化为对象的姿态」。她所使用的对象看来是皿（×3 用同样的手段复活的丰聪耳神子，使用的是宝剑）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说事实上复活的时候会舍弃自己的肉体，变化成什么姿态在某程度上是自由的，但多数尸解仙都会选择变回原来自己近似的姿态。这是因为对自己外表的某种程度的怀恋，以及想为了让他人能认知自己吧。因此她变成了这种感觉很古风的姿态，而神子则变成了这种比较跟现代合得来的姿态。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20139"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/285d59c3a0d383c096329b4a785b777d47c9d82719d735674d9adf6a2c312d86.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d60f4f6b3d29e7662ff4bd4456c7d7fc269f0599091f0cec1c391db60f0c05c9.webp","width":246,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20140","characterName":"宇宙を司る全能道士","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20140","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"宇宙を司る全能道士","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"从长眠中苏醒过来的圣人。刚出生时就已经拥有非同寻常的才能，远远超越了人类的超级人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能够理解同时十个人说的话并准确的给予回答。传闻孩提时代就曾经用白胶木造出过四天王像，并且兴建了四天王寺。另一方面，虽然也有在马厩出生的逸话，但似乎只是个不值一提的玩笑（本人曰「高贵的我，怎可能是在那种臭得要命的地方出世」）（×1 耶稣也被认为有相似的逸闻。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现在成为超越了人类的仙人。但是，却还没完全对俗世的事断绝来往，偶尔还会介入人类社会的事。恐怕是过去身为执政者时残留下来的习惯吧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格意外的洒脱轻浮，老爱开玩笑。但当直接与她面对面时不光容易露出纰漏，甚至有全部都被看透一样的感觉，会变成更多是敬畏的感觉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"尽管听起来很是朴素的能力，始终是得天独厚之物，我想实际上说不定有其他超人的能力那样。所谓生下来就是超人的地方。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此外，同时理解复数人话说是很不容易的事。我虽然也有过耳不忘的能力，但那只能做到顺次序记忆下来。同时两个人说话的话，其中一边的说了什么事最后大多是记不起来吧。然而她却不只都记得，更能理解并作出回答，简直难以想象是人类做得到的事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是正因为有如此敏锐的耳朵，对平时生活也产生出了不少麻烦。她所戴上的耳罩就是为了遮掩人们的声音从而保持心的平稳而存在的道具。除此之外还带有指向性功能，能选择只听到将要消失的微弱得很的声音之类的用途。所谓耳朵是职业道具，就是这样的一回事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另外她还拥有即使对方没直接表达出来，也能从对方说话的方式、表情、行为等读出对方所思所想的能力，有此般洞察力的她跟常人比起来实在是卓尔不群。当那个欲望成为形成对方本体的重要因素的时候。她的能力是接近于读心，差异的地方是在于，后者是读出对方的记忆以及当前的思考内容，而前者却能做到读出对方的资质以及他的未来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"佛教和道教"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来想着她是笃信佛教的，事实上似乎佛教对她来说只是政治道具而已。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"佛教的目标是，把众生从苦难中解放出来。大概这种和平的目标对于为政治世界带来便利是不可或缺的。让民众信仰佛教的话，他们就不会为了自己的利益去逆当权者的意图，神子实际上是这种想法。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"那时候，与佛教同时传来的的宗教，就是道教了。道教的基本理念是，理解所谓的自然宇宙之物，然后把其化为自己的东西，那样的宗教。虽然对于追求更高层次的人类来说是非常有魅力的宗教，但跟佛教不同，要是让其横行于世会产生什么乱子也是很容易想象出来的。要想推翻强力的统治者，必须要拥有比他们更强的力量。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她为了政治而继续利用佛教，另一方面也想得到非比寻常的力量。其中最想要的力量，就是跟众多当权者渴求的一样，不老不死的能力。而这似乎也是她选择信仰道教的理由。因为事实上道教的最终目标，就是不老不死。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20140"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/2964ca2962a4d8e52e0ae22ff4b2b62618cbf05fdc80becbd4a365af83b0b978.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/681311b469f96edfab390d17b17fad6fb839eaf838a25a1770a780cbd51f36ce.webp","width":140,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21128","characterName":"愉快的遗忘之伞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21128","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"21128","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"21128","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"愉快的遗忘之伞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"二面中头目及头目，由长年不被使用的伞化成的妖怪，对于经常吓不了人类而感到自卑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然在关卡的名字是代表着独眼妖怪，不过主要也是指她手上的伞罢了，但本体不是那把伞。瞳孔的颜色一边为蓝，一边为红。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神灵庙又再次出现，与火焰猫磷并列为出现次数最多的头目（四次）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"吓到人会摆出一副很满足的表情，无视她的话会变得很郁卒。不会害人的妖怪，所以不需要担心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"如果可怜可怜她，还是装一下吓到的表情哄她开心吧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人之里中很受小孩子欢迎。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21128"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21128","value":"附丧神（唐伞妖怪）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21128","value":"惊吓人类程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e346d665b3915d9a2fe30f61eadb4e647e0a7b81d0171adb8761c208310fa165.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b85e398e9e9a77bb2864b0c02aa82222489679dd5526a0303a01681c48b5b46.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29690","characterName":"Kaku Seiga","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29690","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Kaku Seiga","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"思考邪恶的事而行动的邪仙。有着只要对自己有利，身边的人类变成怎样都无所谓的思考模式。性格非常的邪恶。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"百岁左右的仙人还是为数不少的，但活了千年以上的仙人已经在修行的途中逐渐减少。她就是这些少数的仙人之一。要问为什么的话，那是因为活到这么长寿的仙人，大多都已经成为了天人或神灵之类的高级种族了，所以像她这样仍故意继续当仙人的存在实在非常稀有。也许是考虑到她邪恶性格的所为也不会习惯跟天人一起生活，但对此她似乎一点都不在意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说跟丰聪耳神子和物部布都等人一同在幻想乡现身，但怎也看得出她的同伴意识似乎很低。她有时看见感兴趣的人类和妖怪就会立即拉拢他们。而幻想乡的具魅力的人物众多，她就每天都这里去那里去晃荡嬉玩着的样子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29690"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29690","value":"邪仙"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29690","value":"穿越墙壁程度的能力（神灵庙、求闻口授）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d040afa4bd6407cb4e59db6f69fad5a4de477f0759a7857092e4bc50b94bf2b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2ae80902d2582314483292728b8eb8cd34d9266aa0e36f17fa81753d8394084f.webp","width":244,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29691","characterName":"Soga no Tojiko","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29691","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Soga no Tojiko","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d75c4b9ee8d05c6fc362c3e9747a52e8661755f7a0007b803283ebb48ef43ea0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d94052a9c287a162689b4de5a9cc0fd21dd0bc21143f2adce4fa60be83091847.webp","width":145,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_30146","characterName":"ふたついわ まみぞう","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"30146","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"30146","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"30146","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ふたついわ まみぞう","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"从外面的世界到来，非常稀有的妖怪狸。比起在幻想乡内独自进化的妖怪，她拥有着古典的姿态和能力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原本她似乎是妖怪狸的首领，有着相应的威严和领导风范，成为新势力的发源可能性很高。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幻想乡原本是栖息了很多妖怪狸的，所以那些野生狸或许有和外来的她联合起来互相关照的必要。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说变身的能力就是不光是自己的姿态，是甚至可以将其他物体也变化的能力，但因为那是跟幻觉没什么分别的东西，所以她是无法制造出无中生有的幻像。无论想要欺骗谁，还是需要一个原本存在的物体的。即使那个物体在变化后也无法变成与其变化对象十分接近的物体，大概马上会被揭穿。例如说，即使狗变身成鸟，却还是不能飞翔，所以马上就会穿帮了。只是外观看上去不同，但性质是几乎没有变化的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"还有，她本人变身时多是无法藏起尾巴的。这说法基本上在全部妖怪狸、妖怪狐狸上都适用，虽然完全藏起尾巴和耳朵是不可能的，但在看不见的位置缩小或是涂上保护色之类伪装成看不见的也是可以。只不过一旦被动摇、紧张或是激动时耳朵和尾巴就会露出来，非常的显眼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此外，尾巴的大小其实就是妖力的计量表，这大抵都是妖兽的宿命吧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这样的她，从最初开始就没有藏起自己尾巴的打算。说是，尾巴大是作为妖兽功力高强的缘故，这样子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有远视并且不时会皱眉头，也会用上了年纪的臭口气说话，说不定这只也是她变身出来的姿态，事实上已经非常的老迈吧（×1 妖怪狸是没有所谓正体的东西）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30146"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46b3fe8556c71fc8a06c1a2ea47136839b88b35a709ca6fe2f2dbc30f32fded3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34a7ccd1bcc14388ceeeb66f23e889afd1abdf43c4cadd30f41ea9557918a55b.webp","width":119,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_485","characterName":"博麗靈夢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"博麗靈夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幻想乡境内博丽神社的现有巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"博丽神社是专门守护幻想乡不可缺少的大结界的神社。博丽的巫女代代以解决异变为事业。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是历代巫女中最缺乏危机感的一位，不知是因为修行不足，还是因为已经拥有足够的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她天生地幸运和敏锐，也退治了不少妖怪。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"主要是在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"作为博丽巫女的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"操纵灵气的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f33007c417ade7c73b7ee78244285c2ff601da86919605a6f56c0570deb01c0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc26d83763ce8144e0a342eaeb5a41bf3e1756ec782d0268170ef9bac39c8489.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_486","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"霧雨魔理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住于魔法森林的人类魔法使，常骑着扫把，「霧雨店」的独生女。會使用魔法森林的蘑菇調製火藥，所使用的魔法幾乎只有把東西破壞的效果，而且燃料需要長時間準備，但是其效果非常強力，在Spell Card規則成立下，純粹的破壞力在人類當中屬於最高等級。此外在幻想乡是出了名的小偷，帕邱莉的图书馆、香霖堂，如果不是古明地觉会读心术，甚至连地灵殿都会惨遭毒手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.d